  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> be the solution of the differential equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />Then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math> is equal to:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
