  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>dx</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>Now, at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>At <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>, then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>6</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>6</mn></msup></math></p>"
